    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/808160/extras/175d4fefa942e0a71b4c20d31a6489d0.avif?t=1701352080\" /></div><br><br>UniverCity is an isometric university management game. Manage your staff, professors and students and try and build the best UniverCity around! Build up your UniverCity solo or against friends and build many different types of classes whilst trying to ensure students get good grades, or maybe just try and build the best looking UniverCity.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/808160/extras/fbba82efd0c54077819f20b8c43c7a58.poster.avif?t=1701352080\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/808160/extras/fbba82efd0c54077819f20b8c43c7a58.webm?t=1701352080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/808160/extras/fbba82efd0c54077819f20b8c43c7a58.mp4?t=1701352080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
